flowchart LR
    FREEZE[Freeze commit + version manifest]
    CHECK[Lint + build + secret scan]
    PACKAGE[Package firmware / app / relay / Pi workspace]
    BENCH[Bench and simulation gate<br/>wheels lifted + STOP]
    MCU[Mega -> ESP32<br/>START / RDY / watchdog]
    PI[Pi target<br/>rosdep + colcon + asar_bringup]
    APP[MobileAPP + relay<br/>lint / build / lease]
    HEALTH[Health gate<br/>TF / odom / scan / camera / diagnostics]
    EXPLORE[Controlled exploratory run]
    EVIDENCE[Evidence bundle + release tag]
    FAIL{Required signal<br/>missing or unsafe?}
    STOP[STOP + power safe + isolate]
    ROLLBACK[Restore previous artifact<br/>and rerun last passing gate]

    FREEZE --> CHECK --> PACKAGE --> BENCH
    BENCH --> MCU
    BENCH --> PI
    BENCH --> APP
    MCU --> HEALTH
    PI --> HEALTH
    APP --> HEALTH
    HEALTH --> FAIL
    FAIL -->|no| EXPLORE --> EVIDENCE
    FAIL -->|yes| STOP --> ROLLBACK --> BENCH
